<channel|>I have implemented the `maxRectangleArea` function in `solution.py` as specified in `goal.md` and `contract.md`. The solution finds all possible rectangles with axis-parallel edges, checks if they contain any other points from the input set (including on the borders), and returns the maximum area among valid ones, or -1 if none exist.
